{"title":"毛主席观看话剧《万水千山》","authors":[],"dates":[{"year":1964,"month":7,"day":5}],"is_range_date":false,"parts":[{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七月二日，毛泽东主席等观看中国人民解放军总政治部文艺工作团话剧团演出的《万水千山》以后，上台和演员合影。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(新华社记者　孟庆彪摄)"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"孟庆彪"}],"comments":[],"origin":"新华社","comment_pivots":[],"description":"","page_start":1,"page_end":1,"alias":""}